<title>GREECE: Greek growth funds hit by redemptions in November.</title>
<headline>Greek growth funds hit by redemptions in November.</headline>
<byline>George Georgiopoulos</byline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most of Greece's 26 equity growth mutual funds were hit with redemptions in November as investors apparently pulled some money out of the stock market.</p>
<p>Based on data provided by the Union of Institutional Investors growth funds experienced redemptions of 5.41 percent on average in November when the bourse was hit by the Delta Securities scandal and closed down for four days.</p>
<p>Growth funds made up only 2.05 percent of the mutual fund industry's assets on November 29 1996. Total mutual fund assets reached 3.72 trillion drachmas.</p>
